Source: hand-made for docsluice: synthetic VSDX package parts written with the Python standard library (the generator script was not kept). LibreOffice 24.2 Draw imports tiny-flow.vsdx with the same text in the same order.
Requirements: IN-5
Notes: Page XML contains an external entity declaration; tests inspect bytes only and do not parse it. Not created or rendered with Microsoft Visio; not a complete Visio-app-validated document.
